// DeepPoker Strategy V2 | CASH6MAX v0.1.0 | self-contained OpenPPL
// Objective: FIRST COMPLETE PLAYABLE HEURISTIC PROFILE, not a solver/GTO claim.
// Cash 6max with 100bb baseline; accepts other stacks with conservative branches.
// Source: professional published concepts + independent broad heuristic choices.
// Default.bot is never relied upon: each street has a final explicit action.
// Caution: respect poker platform rules; intended only where automation permitted.
// Root status: V2 strategy is NEW; DeepCrusher engineering concepts only, not short-stack actions.

